# AI IDE — Complete Feature Implementation Plan

Implement all missing "Antigravity-class" AI IDE features into the existing WPF AIAssistant application. The codebase already has a solid foundation — this plan fills every gap across **12 feature domains**.

---

## Current State Analysis

### ✅ Already Implemented (working)
| Domain | Features |
|--------|----------|
| **Core Agent** | Autonomous agent loop, JSON command parsing, multi-strategy extraction, stuck detection, workspace context, auto-loop |
| **IDE** | Monaco editor (WebView2), file explorer, syntax highlighting, diff viewer (accept/reject), multi-tab editor, code editor tabs |
| **Browser** | Playwright-based `AutonomousAgent`, CDP connection, click/type/scroll/hover, session save/load, human-like cursor |
| **Terminal** | Multi-terminal (cmd.exe), input/output, error colorization, problem detection |
| **Voice** | Background listening, wake words, Google TTS, Windows TTS, manual voice trigger |
